# Cloudflare API token used only for the DNS-01 ACME challenge — copy to
# secrets/caddy.env, fill in, then `./scripts/secrets encrypt`.
#
# Create at: Cloudflare dashboard -> My Profile -> API Tokens -> Create.
# Scope it as narrowly as possible:
#   Permissions:    Zone / DNS / Edit
#   Zone Resources: Include / Specific zone / <your domain>
#
# This is NOT a Global API Key — never use one of those here. A scoped
# token can only touch DNS records on the one zone.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
